/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the middle sat at 33% of normal for January to February and 207% for June to July. Grid 26235 had its driest year in 1976, at 52% of normal.</p>"}
